#. Tag: title
#: man-indi_lx200generic.1.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripcion"

#. Tag: para
#: man-indi_lx200generic.1.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; allows you to configure and control astronomical instruments such "
"as telescopes and focusers via the <acronym>INDI</acronym> protocol. "
"<command>indi_lx200generic</command> is a device driver for supporting "
"particular types of external hardware."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-indi_lx200generic.1.docbook:41
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This driver is not intended to be run directly. Instead you should use "
"&kstars; to configure and operate your astronomical instruments. Most "
"operations can be found under the <guimenu>Devices</guimenu> menu in "
"&kstars;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-indi_lx200generic.1.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; will start the <acronym>INDI</acronym> server internally, and the "
"<acronym>INDI</acronym> server will in turn start this device driver."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-indi_lx200generic.1.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Much more detailed information can be found in the &kstars; handbook as "
"described below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-indi_lx200generic.1.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kstars; is a graphical desktop planetarium for &kde; and forms part of the "
"official &kde; edutainment module."
msgstr ""

